       WHY A NEW VERSION RATHER THAN RIDING 0.50.6. `kit-auto-publish` tags on merge to `main`, so
       0.50.6 was cut and published from .github#2512's merge commit 8de950c3 minutes before this
       branch merged `origin/main` — measured, not assumed: `git merge-base` in its ancestor-test form
